    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαυξής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily elongated,
