				<u>PA</u>
			</span></i>l.c., Thphr.l.c. (codd. Urb., 
				Med.
			), <u>Gp.</u>l.c., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαυξ</span>-v.l. ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.13.3
